		(property "Description" "Generic 2-line low-capacitance ESD protection array, SOT-23-6L. 17V clamp, 5A Ipp. Feedthrough layout per ST datasheet Figure 1: pins 1/6=I/O1 (same net, route through), pins 3/4=I/O2 (same net, route through), pins 2/5=GND. Commonly used for USB D+/D- (I/O1=D-, I/O2=D+ by convention) but is not USB-specific."
			(at 59.69 62.23 0)
			(hide yes)
