		)
		(property "Description" "USB-C (GCT USB4120-03-C, LCSC C3445864) receptacle. Symbol redrawn to match the previous USB-C-16P layout for drop-in rewiring; the 12 signal pins (GND1/2, VBUS1/2, CC1/2, D+/D-, SBU1/2) keep the old positions/names. This is a full USB-C footprint, so it exposes the extra power pads: VBUS3/4 (A9/B9) and GND3/4 (A12/B12) appended below - tie them to the VBUS and GND nets. The two old shield tabs collapse to the single shell pad 0."
			(at 140.97 58.42 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
